{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10273020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10273020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1027302001:0":{"text":"チェッ！ツイてねえなあ！こんなところでまた会うなんてよ！","source_cn":"啧，真是不巧啊，居然在这儿重逢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81AB50F52518A78A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027302002:0":{"text":"お前は、あの時のトレジャーハンター！どおりで聞き覚えがある声なわけだ！","source_cn":"你是那个——宝藏猎人！怪不得声音那么耳熟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC51188AA3C980229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027302003:1":{"text":"確か、ユグドラシルに来たのは隠された財宝を探すためだと言っていましたが……見たところ、あなたの狙いは<style=\"highlight\">鹿霊の財宝</style>ですね？","source_cn":"我记得你说过，来薄暮丛林是为了寻找隐秘的宝藏……这么看...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB827A2D97D9F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027302004:1":{"text":"ヘヘン！察しのとおりさ！アンタらがこんなに早くここまで来るとは思わなかったぜ。どうやらアンタらにもこの手の才能がありそうだな。","source_cn":"嗯哼，没错，没想到你们居然来得这么快。看起来你们也挺有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x015FE3A8BE432219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027302005:1":{"text":"よし！バレちまったからには、これ以上隠す必要もねえ。そうさ。アタシはこの財宝のためにやってきたんだ。","source_cn":"好吧，既然被你们发现了，那我也不绕弯子了。没错，我就是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3FB2C3B8D6320A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027302006:1":{"text":"とはいえ、ここに来て気付いたんだが、残念なことに、仕掛けが壊れちまってるみたいなんだ。","source_cn":"——很可惜，到了这边我才发现，这里的机关出了问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47493FC95739C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1027302006":{"text":"とはいえ、ここに来て気付いたんだが、残念なことに、仕掛けが壊れちまってるみたいなんだ。","source_cn":"——很可惜，到了这边我才发现，这里的机关出了问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD47493FC95739C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027302007:1":{"text":"知るかよ！とにかくいくらいじってもなんの反応もないんだ。","source_cn":"天晓得，反正我摆弄了半天都没反应。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x123202894AA3EB49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027302010:1":{"text":"それにしても、おかしなこともあるもんだ。普通、こういう神が残した古代の仕掛けってのは壊れないものだけどな。いったいどうしちまったのかね？","source_cn":"不过，真是奇怪啊。照理说，这种以神之名存留的古代机关通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24917D3DB5585D62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027302011:1":{"text":"ずっと補修されてなかったから、サビちまったのかな？","source_cn":"难不成年久失修，生锈了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C97F38FBD4E708A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027302012:1":{"text":"適当なことを言うな！鹿霊の残した物がサビるはずないだろう！？","source_cn":"你在胡说什么？！鹿灵留下的东西怎么可能生锈？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43F3855856F2B55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027302013:1":{"text":"ああ、それもそうだな。この仕掛けは木で出来てる。言うなれば、コケが生えて腐っちまったってとこだな。","source_cn":"啊——很有道理，这里的机关都是木制，要说的话也是长了苔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925B73105FD478CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027302014:1":{"text":"お、お前は！鹿霊に対してなんということを！","source_cn":"你——你这家伙！居然对鹿灵不敬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC956EC7912028B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027302015:1":{"text":"アタシはただ神よりも大自然の法則を信じてるだけだ。","source_cn":"不不不，只是比起神明，我更相信大自然的规律。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DFA31DB4629B696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1027302016:1":{"text":"アタシの言うことが信じられないなら、どうして自分の目で見ないんだい？実際に見れば信じられるだろ？","source_cn":"如果不相信我说的，为什么不亲自去看看呢？眼见为实嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88CB77A133719799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"どこに問題が？","source_cn":"什么问题？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1D98D88280254379","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"どこに問題が？","female":"どこに問題が？","variant_male_record_index":"61256","variant_female_record_index":"61257","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027302008:1":{"text":"アンタも言ってただろ？謎だって！解けるのは謎だけなんだ。故障は修理されるしかないんだよ。","source_cn":"你也说了，那得是谜题。谜题才能解开，故障只能被维修。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x40DDB078EF546BEF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"アンタも言ってただろ？謎だって！解けるのは謎だけなんだ。故障は修理されるしかないんだよ。","female":"アンタも言ってただろ？謎だって！解けるのは謎だけなんだ。故障は修理されるしかないんだよ。","variant_male_record_index":"109476","variant_female_record_index":"109477","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1027302009:1":{"text":"あいにく、修理の経験はほとんどなくてね。だから、あれこれ調べながらやってるんだ。","source_cn":"不巧，我对修理这行暂时没多少涉猎，所以正在研究呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF78304B5CCC2F407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"謎が解けてないんじゃないか？","source_cn":"你也会解不开谜题？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0B58BE3175F1A363","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"謎が解けてないんじゃないか？","female":"謎が解けてないんじゃない？","variant_male_record_index":"61258","variant_female_record_index":"61259","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"アタランテ","source":"阿塔兰忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":